<h1>Findings per CI</h1>
<p class="lede">One row per CI and finding: the finding on the CI that holds it, with its state (open, reopened or closed), when it was first detected and last seen. A CI's risk score is the sum of its findings' scores. The same rows reach the findings workbook through its output fields (<nav-ref page="/Reports/Index" />).</p>
